Bahut badhiya 🙌 — agar tumhe **console me print karna hai “service name works”** jab service chale, to tumharī services me constructor ya method ke andar `console.log()` likh sakte ho.  

Chalo updated code dekhte hain 👇  

---

### 🧩 `user.service.ts`
```typescript
import { Injectable } from '@angular/core';

@Injectable({
  providedIn: 'root'
})
export class UserService {
  constructor() {
    console.log('✅ UserService works');
  }

  getUserName(): string {
    console.log('UserService: getUserName() called');
    return 'Outlier User';
  }
}
```

